+   - `python -m compileall -q src/csk`: exit 0.
+   - `git diff --check`: exit 0.
+
+6. Distribution build:
+
+   `python -m build --outdir .temp/TASK-260720-2jfnz6/dist-final.kaT6Yd`
+
