+
+Date: 2026-07-30
+
+## Provenance and scope
+
+- Product repository: `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills`
+- Existing task worktree:
+  `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-2jfnz6/worktree`
